 26","resolution":"2K","aspectRatio":"4:3","quality":"high","imageSize":"auto","results":[{"url":"{{user-upload}}","text":"","timestamp":"2026-09-17T07:46:42.844Z","runIndex":0},{"url":"{{user-upload}}","text":"","timestamp":"2026-09-17T07:52:02.085Z","runIndex":1}],"activeRunIndex":1,"mediaWidth":1184,"mediaHeight":864},"width":320,"height":351,"style":{"width":320,"height":351},"measured":{"width":320,"height":351},"selected":false,"dragging":false},{"id":"textNode-xq06qGxLdIDVHSLZ6_WV_","type":"textNode","position":{"x":19832.305434336522,"y":-3286.0746091895735},"data":{"text":"Create a photorealistic cinematic lifestyle advertising photograph set in a rural Southeast Asian rice field during warm late-afternoon sunlight. A strong, lean Southeast Asian male rice farmer is standing knee-deep in a muddy rice paddy, caught in an energetic moment while planting or pulling rice seedlings. He is shirtless, covered with wet mud and splashes of soil, wearing dark loose farmer's shorts with a red patterned cloth tied around his waist, and a large woven straw farmer's hat.\nThe man is captured in a dramatic dynamic pose: his legs spread wide for balance, his body leaning slightly forward, one arm raised high above his head gripping a large bundle of freshly pulled rice seedlings with exposed roots and clumps of wet soil. His face shows intense physical effort and exaggerated determination, with clenched teeth and a humorous, energetic expression.\nFreeze the action at the most dynamic moment, with chunks of wet mud, water droplets, loose soil and tiny rice roots suspended in the air around him. Capture the movement sharply and clearly, creating a powerful sense of motion and physical energy.\n\nCharacter: the son, keep his hat\n\n\nEnvironment : Rice field farm land, reference to 110, 111\n\nVisual style: a naturalistic French New Wave film aesthetic inspired by the intimate, observational cinema of Eric Rohmer. Bright natural daylight, soft summer sunlight, realistic outdoor locations, understated cinematic composition, candid everyday moments, relaxed and spontaneous body language, characters naturally integrated into their environment. Warm but restrained color palette with soft greens, pale blues, creamy whites and subtle earthy tones. Natural skin tones, gentle sunlight on faces, soft shadows, slightly lifted blacks and delicate film grain. Shot on 35mm film with a 50mm or 65mm lens, medium depth of field around f/3.5–f/5.6, give head room, realistic perspective, moderate subject-background separation, background remaining recognizable rather than heavily blurred. Slightly imperfect analog texture, soft highlight roll-off, natural exposure, subtle lens softness and authentic film color rendition. The image should feel observed rather than staged — quiet, spontaneous, intimate, youthful, conversational and effortlessly elegant. Avoid glossy commercial photography, dramatic lighting, heavy color grading, excessive contrast, artificial bokeh, HDR, extreme sharpness, overly polished skin, or contemporary fashion-editorial styling.\n\nAvoid: studio lighting, artificial beauty retouching, plastic skin, extreme HDR, excessive sharpness, extreme bokeh, oversaturated colors, heavy orange-and-teal grading, dramatic Hollywood lighting, perfect symmetry, artificial-looking steam, CGI appearance.\n","name":"Text Node 25","errorMessage":null},"width":670,"height":849,"style":{"width":670,"height":849},"measured":{"width":670,"height":849},"selected":false,"dragging":false,"resizing":false},{"id":"imageUpload-6gUlRjaxPCmj9ecqpJNYx","type":"imageUpload","position":{"x":18131.430877504652,"y":388.6108932262797},"data":{"imageUrl":"{{user-upload}}","filename":"Screenshot 2026-09-17 at 3.58.32 PM.png","uploadStatus":"completed","errorMessage":null,"mediaWidth":3838,"mediaHeight":2154,"mediaUrl":"{{user-upload}}","name":"Image 62"},"width":320,"height":274,"style":{"width":320,"height":274},"measured":{"width":320,"height":274},"selected":false,"dr